---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import imgMockup from "../assets/images/imagem_r4t_200h.webp";
---

<section id="metodo" class="overflow-hidden border-t border-gray-900 bg-black px-4 py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="mb-16 text-center">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-red uppercase">
        O segredo revelado
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 mb-6 text-3xl font-black text-white md:text-5xl">
        Apresentando o Projeto:
        <br /> <span class="text-brand-red">Rei do 4Trinho</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-xl font-medium text-gray-400">
        Não é um PDF teórico. Nós filmamos e documentamos o passo a passo exato da montagem de um
        motor de baixo custo que extrai o máximo de cavalaria com segurança extrema.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-10 md:grid md:grid-cols-2">
      {/* Imagem - Primeiro no mobile */}
      <div class="order-1 flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center md:order-2">
        <Image
          src={imgMockup}
          alt="Imagem da moto +200km/h"
          class="h-auto w-full max-w-none object-contain transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-[1.05] md:w-[140%] md:origin-left lg:w-[150%]"
          width={800}
          height={600}
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      {/* Card com os Bullets - Segundo no mobile */}
      <div class="relative order-2 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-900 bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 shadow-2xl md:order-1 md:p-12">
        {/* Background Effect */}
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 right-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-brand-red/10 blur-[80px]"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10 space-y-8">
          <h3 class="mb-8 text-2xl leading-tight font-black tracking-tight md:text-3xl">
            <span class="text-[#FF3333] uppercase">
              Esse é o segredo para
              <br />
              passar dos 200km/h
            </span>
          </h3>

          <ul class="space-y-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="mt-1 flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#FF3333] text-white shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,51,51,0.4)]">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="4"
                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="mb-1 block text-lg text-white">Cabeçote de Alta Vazão</strong>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">
                  O duto, as sedes e as válvulas exatas para maximizar o fluxo sem perder
                  velocidade.
                </span>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="mt-1 flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#FF3333] text-white shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,51,51,0.4)]">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="4"
                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="mb-1 block text-lg text-white">Super Taxa de Compressão</strong>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">
                  Como usar uma taxa acima de 14:1 sem derreter o pistão e sem amarrar o motor.
                </span>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="mt-1 flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#FF3333] text-white shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,51,51,0.4)]">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="4"
                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="mb-1 block text-lg text-white">Comando sob medida</strong>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">
                  A cereja do bolo. Configuração completa do comando para a moto acordar cedo e não
                  parar de render em alta.
                </span>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="mt-1 flex h-8 w-8 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#FF3333] text-white shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,51,51,0.4)]">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="4"
                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="mb-1 block text-lg text-white">Acerto Fino</strong>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">
                  O mapa para cravar os 32cv na roda e fazer a moto passar dos +200km/h reais.
                </span>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
